&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 13.5pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -13.5pt; font-size: 9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 6pt; vertical-align: super;"&gt;(1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 2.98pt; text-indent: 0pt; display: inline-block; -aw-tabstop-align: left; -aw-tabstop-pos: 13pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Includes amounts charged for services, pass through costs, asset and liability transfers, and other items in accordance with the approved AIA. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
