&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Our average amount of short-term borrowings based on daily outstanding balances during &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; was $58.1 million with a weighted-average interest rate during the period of 4.51%.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 5pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;The information in the table below relates to our financing commitment with our parent, including remaining available capacity under this arrangement as of December 31:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table style="width: 540pt; border-collapse: collapse;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
