&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 6.75pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Consistent with ratemaking treatment, deferred taxes in the table above are offset for temporary differences that have related regulatory assets and liabilities. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 6.75pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;As of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;31, 2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;, we had no federal or state deferred tax assets related to tax benefit carryforwards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Unrecognized Tax Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;We had no unrecognized tax benefits at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;31, 2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;For the years ended &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;31, 2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;2023&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;, we had no interest expense or penalties related to unrecognized tax benefits in our income statements. At &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;31, 2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;, we had no interest accrued and no penalties accrued related to unrecognized tax benefits in our balance sheets. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Our primary tax jurisdictions include federal and the state of Michigan. At &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;31, 2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;, we were no longer subject to examination by the IRS for tax years prior to 2022. At &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;31, 2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;, we were subject to examination by the Michigan taxing authority for tax years 2021 through 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Cash Paid to WEC Energy Group, Inc. for Income Taxes, Net&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 5pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;The table below is a summary of income taxes paid to WEC Energy Group by jurisdiction for the years ended December 31:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
