&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;The derivative assets listed in the tables above include physical commodity contracts used to manage market risks related to changes in natural gas supply costs and FTRs, which are used to manage electric transmission congestion costs in the MISO Energy Markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
