      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>310 L1g</p>
        <p>MISO RTO Netting of energy transactions is performed hourly. FERC requires that the RTO Netting of energy transactions be calculated separately for Day Ahead and Real Time markets.</p>
        <table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.573%; height: 176px;" border="1" width="367pt" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
          <tbody>
            <tr style="height: 15.75pt;">
