        <p>262 L6i</p>
        <p>Adjustment for property tax accrual to charge account 174.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHC8917A163CCD9DD619BCAC6A4F073048" xlink:to="HH6E74FFD279F65EE65253494557CA2850" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHEECE7935ACF6732DCEF1430EAB8D0CFF" xlink:label="HHEECE7935ACF6732DCEF1430EAB8D0CFF" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH539AFE8B12255C658993B21292DA1958" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>332 L1a</p>
        <p>Network transmission is billed by ATC (billing agent), but is reported under MISO since MISO is the transmission provider; ATC acts as the billing agent in order to facilitate the billing process.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHEECE7935ACF6732DCEF1430EAB8D0CFF" xlink:to="HH539AFE8B12255C658993B21292DA1958" order="1" />
