    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH37686CD3917764EA7381C87C6703E713" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>332 L1g</p>
        <p>Other charges consist of Schedule 2 - Reactive Supply &amp; Voltage Control, Schedule 26 - Network Upgrade, Schedule 26A - Multi-Value Project Cost Recovery, Schedule 26D - Cost Recover,&#160; Schedule 33 - Blackstart Service&#160; and Attachment BB Reimbursement.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
