        <p>326 L1g</p>
        <p>MISO RTO Netting of energy transactions is performed hourly. FERC requires that the RTO Netting of energy transactions be calculated separately for Day Ahead and Real Time markets. The PSCW allows the combined netting of Day Ahead and Real Time energy transactions which conforms with GAAP and is used for SEC reporting.</p>
